    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "jump",
        "xpos": 0,
        "power": 40,
        "times": 3,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss, miss!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa, what's the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My dada said you're a hero who helped the village, so you've gotta be really strong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm~ Are heroes all strong people, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heroes are just willing to help, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amazing... ah, look, miss, here's the guesthouse I was talking about!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's called the Tsui... Tsui-ch'ing Lou!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsui', 'Ch'ing', 'Lou.' Those are some real pretty Yan words. You can read 'em?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I can!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_142#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sweet, let's go in and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
