        "name2": "avg_npc_138#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoh... they came twice in one day. Why so frequent?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "'In one day'... you mean 'in twenty-four hours,' right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "It really is a pain that daylight and nighttime don't ever switch. If you overslept, you'd end up losing track of time forever, wouldn't you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha, sleeping in is no good habit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though I must note how unruffled you are, Miss Lava. Presumably you did not cower when those monsters first appeared to you, either?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "These things happen. And you seem pretty calm yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "See the sun strong above our heads. Those monsters would never make their way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nobody'll get hurt, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're slow to escape, I fear they're unavoidable... If you do not lose your life, then you are already very lucky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Umbrella-Boiler... I have a suggestion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll help P'o-shan Village pass the Dusk Ridding safely. Those monsters aren't strong, and we'll give it all we have to ensure the villagers' safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to wait until P'o-shan Village is safe, and then I'd like you to help us leave, Mr. Umbrella-Boiler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave? Here? That of course is easily done, but... you've only just arrived, Miss. Are you truly willing to endanger yourself for us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem. Those monsters only look scary. They're not actually that tough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Then let me first thank you, on behalf of all in P'o-shan Village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
