    {
        "text": "M\u2014My benefactors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "times": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oho, so thou art the benefactor Lava that Nothing spoke of! Well met, well met. I am Saga, humble servant of the Buddha, from Higashi\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now now now, Master, Master, the self-introduction can wait! Those Ink Spirits have plunged straight into the village!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Mo'... fiend...? 'Liang'... two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Tis the name I chose for those monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "'Ink Spirit'... 'Mo-liang', a liang of the ch'ih, mei, wang and liang monsters. Very good. We finally have a unified way to address them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_138#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Those Ink... Ink Spirits aren't much of a threat. You don't need to be so nervous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! Quite imposing! I approve!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#3",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor, I feel this time might be somewhat different...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's different?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're, well, er, a bit of a... horde?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
